sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Mobile Client
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    C->>A: Any protected request with header "Authorization: Bearer <token>"

    alt Token missing, invalid, or expired
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail (Authentication Required)
        Note over C: Re-authenticate via POST /auth/google, then retry.
    else Valid token
        A-->>C: 2xx response for the requested endpoint
    end

    Note over C,A: Applies to every endpoint except POST /auth/google and POST /auth/register.
